    <string name="onb_1_title">Meet Sol, your pocket assistant</string>
    <string name="onb_1_body">Hold the mic and just talk. Sol knows your calls, your reminders and your wallet, in English or Ukrainian.</string>
    <string name="onb_2_title">It answers the phone for you</string>
    <string name="onb_2_body">The AI secretary picks up on a real phone line, takes a note, writes the transcript and can block spam numbers. You read a short summary later.</string>
    <string name="onb_3_title">An agent wallet on Solana</string>
    <string name="onb_3_body">Sol can mint and run agents and sign your daily check-in on Solana devnet. Nothing moves without your tap on Confirm.</string>
    <string name="as_skills">I answer your phone when you can\'t: the secretary picks up, takes a note and writes the transcript, and I tell you what mattered. I keep your follow-ups and reminders from those calls. I also look after your agent wallet on Solana devnet: I can start, stop or retune an agent, but every on-chain step waits for your Confirm. Ask me about your calls, your agents or your day.</string>
